  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融科技概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION OF FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將介紹近期金融科技和數據應用的發展趨勢，課程內容將涵蓋第三方支付、P2P借款、眾籌、線上投資平台、交易策略回測平台、大數據分析及應用…等等；除此之外，我們將介紹國內外金融業的實際案例並進行分析，協助同學認識金融科技和數據發展的趨勢。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will introduce the innovations of financial technology and applications of data, which cover the following topics, including payments, crowdfunding, online investment platforms, trading backtesting systems, big data, etc. In addition, we will introduce the local and global case studies to provide students with the insights of the development of financial technology and applications of financial data.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
